Cockpit — Vendored Termux terminal core
=======================================

This directory contains a vendored, adapted subset of the Termux terminal stack:

  * com.termux.terminal — terminal emulator (Terminal Emulator for Android /
    jackpal Android-Terminal-Emulator code)
  * com.termux.view — terminal view, renderer and text selection

Upstream project: Termux (https://github.com/termux/termux-app)
Pinned commit:    3df69d1da197dd9bd71a3bafd902dffd720576b4
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE and UPSTREAM.md)
Copyright:        Copyright (C) The Termux Project contributors and the
                  original Android-Terminal-Emulator authors

Adaptations by the Cockpit project:
  * TerminalSession.java was adapted into a transport-neutral session
    (local shell process / PTY / JNI support removed; remote input/output
    seams added). See UPSTREAM.md for the exact adaptation list.
  * JNI.java and the native jni/ directory of terminal-emulator are
    intentionally not vendored.
  * Module build files (build.gradle.kts) are new.

